# Paths in this workspace the PERSON never sees as pages.
#
# Founder ruling 2026-09-02: a new desk keeps its machinery — the agent reads CLAUDE.md, the flows,
# the skills, the routines, the views and the entity templates on every turn — but none of it is
# content, and a person who opens a desk should not be handed the product's own wiring as their
# documents. He signed in as a new user and was shown a README template rendered as a page.
#
# The list is DATA, not code, so the terminal and the agent read one source instead of each keeping
# a copy of the rule that drifts. One glob per line; `#` comments and blank lines ignored.
# A path listed here is still committed, still mounted, still read by the agent — only hidden from
# the tree and never opened as a tab.
CLAUDE.md
.vexa-machinery
.gitignore
flows/**
skills/**
routines/**
views/**
kg/templates/**
kg/.gateignore
